  "refund_policy_summary": "For summer camps, a $25 per week deposit is taken when you register, and the rest is charged automatically 14 days before camp starts. Changing camps or weeks costs $10 and can be done up to 14 days before camp. Later changes need the Camp Director's approval. The page does not give a refund policy for summer camps. (For Vacation Camps, deposits are non-refundable.)",
  "special_needs_notes": "Families of children with special needs or who need accommodations should contact the relevant Camp Director before registering.",
